        "reason": "The physical two-column page places acid classification, oxygen-containing inorganic acids, behaviour rules and acid-rain examples in the right remarks column, alongside responsibility/sustainability references. The introductory curriculum rules assign remarks recommendation character. The candidate correctly separates them from additional universally mandatory left-column duties. SE is aligned with the indented investigation and does not make that left experimental operator optional; investigation cannot be replaced by supplied colours. This local column qualification does not waive safety duties from other sources or local lab rules."
